<Layout title="Terms of Service — Stuck Between Pixels" description="The terms that govern your use of stuckbetweenpixels.com, including acceptable use, content ownership, and third-party links.">
  <article class="prose dark:prose-invert mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16 md:px-8">
    <h1 class="display-tight text-4xl font-medium">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="kicker text-fg-muted">Effective August 27, 2026</p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-fg-muted">
      These Terms of Service govern your use of stuckbetweenpixels.com (the
      "Site"), operated by MrDemonWolf, Inc. ("we," "our," or "us") on behalf
      of the Stuck Between Pixels podcast. By using the Site, you agree to
      these terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">1. What this site is</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      The Site is an informational website about the Stuck Between Pixels
      podcast: episode information, show notes, and links to where the
      podcast is actually hosted and distributed (Spotify for Creators, Apple
      Podcasts, and other platforms). It has no accounts, no payments, and no
