      <li>Use the Site in any way that violates applicable law.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">3. Content and intellectual property</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      All podcast content, episode titles, descriptions, artwork, and the
      Stuck Between Pixels name and logo are owned by MrDemonWolf, Inc. and
      its co-host, unless otherwise noted. You may share links to the Site
      and its episodes; you may not republish substantial portions of its
      content as your own.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">4. Third-party links</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      The Site links to third-party services we do not control, including
      Spotify, Apple Podcasts, and the hosts' individual businesses
      (mrdemonwolf.com, moerman.dev). We aren't responsible for the content,
      accuracy, or practices of those third-party sites.
