    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, MrDemonWolf, Inc. is not liable
      for any damages arising from your use of the Site or reliance on its
      content.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">7. Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the Site
      after changes means you accept the updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">8. Contact</h2>
